<div class="modal c-modal" id="myModal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content" id="modalContent">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h5 class="modal-title">以下の予約を削除しますか？</h5>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="c-modal__body">
          <%= image_tag reservation.room.room_image, class: "c-modal__body--image"%>
          <div  class="c-modal__body--text">
            <p><%= reservation.room.name %></p>
            <p><%= l reservation.check_in_date %> 〜 <%= l reservation.check_out_date %></p>
            <p><%= reservation.count %>人</p>
            <p>¥<%= hotel_bill(reservation).to_s(:delimited) %></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>よろしければ「削除」ボタンを押してください。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <%= button_to "削除", reservation_path(reservation), method: :delete, class: "btn btn-danger button" %>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary button" id="cancel">キャンセル</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
